    "category": "Weighing module",
    "type_designations": ["PL.xxx.PM.yyy", "PM.xxx.yyy"],
    "module_designation": "Not applicable",
    "description": "Weighing module (platform) for non-automatic weighing instruments. Devices: Zero indicator; Stability indicator; Internal adjustment; Service menu via switch on the main board; Initial zero-setting; Zero-tracking; Semi-automatic zero setting device; Subtractive tare device; Semi-automatic and automatic tare device; Tare-weighing device; Preset tare device; Data Storage Device (Alibi memory). PM weighing modules have no DSD of their own and are intended to use the DSD of the connected terminal. Equipped with RS 485 interface dedicated for connecting terminals (compliant with 5.3.6 of OIML R 76). Embedded weighing software version 1.0.0 or 1.0.1, fixed hardware/software environment, cannot be modified or uploaded after securing and/or verification; software identification possible after connecting terminal."
